                        "review": "super fun, the meta is enjoyable, unlike a lot of these hero soccer type games. no being stuck as goalie without action for minutes on end. very fast paced, chaotic at first until you learn abilities, doesnt take more than 5-6 hours to have a good understanding of everything.\n\nHUGE downside is no online mm 2v2, its a 2v2 game but the matchmaker FORCES you to play with a bot, you CAN CONTROL the bot, but its still so much worse than a regular 2v2 could be.",
